<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soymeal export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 163,300 MT were one-quarter below the week earlier and 30 percent below of the 4-week average.  Major increases were for Thailand (49,000 MT including 85,000 in new sales and 36,000 in cancellations), Spain (40,000 MT), Colombia (25,000 MT), Canada (19,400 MT), and Turkey (12,000 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 96,800 MT were one-third below the previous week and 23 percent less than the 4-week average.  Saudi Arabia (25,500 MT), Canada (18,200 MT), Japan (15,300 MT), and Venezuela (14,900 MT) were the major destinations.</p>
</text>
